# Arca working-copy exclusions. Edit this file to customize this share.
# Gitignore syntax: *, **, ?, [abc], /root-path, directory/, and !exceptions.
# Rules are case-insensitive. Ignored files stay on disk and in existing history.
# This root .arcaignore always synchronizes; nested .arcaignore files are ordinary files.

# System metadata and trash
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.Trash/
.Trash-*/
.Trashes/
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.Spotlight-V100/
.TemporaryItems/
.fseventsd/

# Regenerable caches and environments
cache/
.cache/
node_modules/
.venv/

# Local Git data (including worktree pointer files)
.git
